   "end": 44.98,
   "text": "It's about D, O, I, V, E, N, T."
  },
  {
   "start": 44.98,
   "end": 48.98,
   "text": "And I mentioned how this E and T we add for they is inaudible."
  },
  {
   "start": 48.98,
   "end": 50.98,
   "text": "We don't hear it."
  },
  {
   "start": 50.98,
   "end": 54.98,
   "text": "If we add this E and T for they to a normal ER verb,"
  },
  {
   "start": 54.98,
   "end": 56.98,
   "text": "a normal French verb ending ER,"
  },
  {
   "start": 56.98,
   "end": 59.98,
   "text": "all it's going to do is make us hear the last consonant."
  },
  {
   "start": 59.98,
   "end": 63.98,
   "text": "So the verb will once again just sound like the two form"
  },
  {
   "start": 63.98,
   "end": 65.98,
   "text": "without the ER ending."
  },
  {
   "start": 65.98,
   "end": 67.98,
   "text": "So what was to eat?"
