   "text": "as the E and T is not pronounced when it's on the end of verbs,"
  },
  {
   "start": 76.98,
   "end": 79.98,
   "text": "it's just going to make us hear that last consonant."
  },
  {
   "start": 79.98,
   "end": 83.22,
