   "text": "but without this ER ending,"
  },
  {
   "start": 100.22,
   "end": 103.22,
   "text": "which of course just gives us this meaning of two."
  },
  {
   "start": 103.22,
   "end": 108.22,
   "text": "So give me, he eats, il mange,"
  },
