  },
  {
   "start": 123.22,
   "end": 125.22,
   "text": "So that all sounds the same, no?"
  },
  {
   "start": 125.22,
   "end": 126.22,
   "text": "So in the spoken language,"
  },
  {
   "start": 126.22,
   "end": 129.22,
   "text": "there will be mostly context that allows you to decipher"
  },
  {
   "start": 129.22,
